@startmindmap
* Sentry capture policy boundary
** API exception / transaction
*** gebaut: FastAPIIntegration
*** gebaut: StarletteIntegration
** Init policy
*** gebaut: main.py::_sentry_init_options
*** offen: include_local_variables explicit false
*** offen: max_request_body_size explicit never
** Event construction
*** gebaut: stack and exception metadata
*** implicit default: frame locals
*** implicit default: request body
** Defense filter
*** gebaut: main.py::_before_send_filter
*** redacts known sensitive keys and request fields
** Transport
*** gebaut: Sentry SDK envelope transport
** Regression tests
*** partial: hook wiring and known-secret redaction
*** offen: arbitrary local/body exclusion
@endmindmap

